# Naomi 2 Initial-D FFB effect settings

# set the global strength of all effects here (0-100)
GLOBAL_GAIN 100

# adjust friction effect if necessary here
MIN_FRICTION 1
MAX_FRICTION 100

# adjust constant effect if necessary here
MIN_CONSTANT 1
MAX_CONSTANT 100

# adjust sine effect intensity if necessary here (default is 0-100)
MIN_INTENSITY 5
MAX_INTENSITY 100

# for those who want to use a Logitech racing wheel which is supported by new-lg4ff
# it is possible to set steering range up to 900 degree (i.e. G25, G27),
LOGITECH_STEERING_RANGE 700